const shell={"en":{"nav":["Home","Projects","Ecosystem","Team","Vision","Sponsors","News","About Us"],"footer":["That's why we chose the name Vertex, which encompasses all these meanings and more. Founded in Istanbul in 2023, we began operating in over 190 countries. In line with the meaning of Vertex, we will demonstrate our full potential and reach the top together; we will bring prosperity to humanity and shape the technologies of tomorrow.","Projects","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Company","About Us","Team","Vision","Contact","Send Email","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Privacy Policy","Terms of Use"],"privacyPath":"/en/privacy-policy"},"tr":{"nav":["Ana Sayfa","Projeler","Ekosistem","Ekip","Vizyon","Sponsorlar","Haberler","Hakkımızda"],"footer":["İşte bu yüzden bütün bu anlamları ve daha fazlasını kapsayan Vertex ismini seçtik. 2023 yılında İstanbul'da kurulduk ve 190'dan fazla ülkede faaliyet göstermeye başladık. Vertex isminin anlamına uygun olarak potansiyelimizin tamamını ortaya koyup hep birlikte zirveye ulaşacağız; insanlığa refah sağlayacak ve geleceğin teknolojilerine yön vereceğiz.","Projeler","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Şirket","Hakkımızda","Ekip","Vizyon","İletişim","E-posta Gönder","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Gizlilik Politikası","Kullanım Şartları"],"privacyPath":"/tr/gizlilik-politikasi"},"ar":{"nav":["الرئيسية","المشاريع","المنظومة","الفريق","الرؤية","الشركاء","الأخبار","من نحن"],"footer":["لهذا اخترنا اسم Vertex الذي يجمع هذه المعاني كلها وأكثر. تأسسنا في إسطنبول عام 2023 وبدأنا العمل في أكثر من 190 دولة. وانطلاقًا من معنى اسم Vertex، سنطلق كامل إمكاناتنا ونصل معًا إلى القمة، وسنسهم في ازدهار البشرية ونشكّل تقنيات الغد.","المشاريع","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","الشركة","معلومات عنا","الفريق","الرؤية","اتصل","إرسال بريد إلكتروني","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","سياسة الخصوصية","شروط الاستخدام"],"privacyPath":"/ar/siyasat-al-khususiyya"},"az":{"nav":["Ana Səhifə","Layihələr","Ekosistem","Komanda","Baxış","Tərəfdaşlar","Xəbərlər","Haqqımızda"],"footer":["Məhz buna görə bütün bu mənaları və daha artığını özündə birləşdirən Vertex adını seçdik. 2023-cü ildə İstanbulda təsis olunduq və 190-dan çox ölkədə fəaliyyətə başladıq. Vertex adının mənasına uyğun olaraq bütün potensialımızı ortaya qoyub birlikdə zirvəyə çatacaq, bəşəriyyətin rifahına töhfə verəcək və gələcəyin texnologiyalarını formalaşdıracağıq.","Layihələr","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Şirkət","Haqqımızda","Komanda","Baxış","Əlaqə","E-poçt Göndər","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Məxfilik Siyasəti","İstifadə Şərtləri"],"privacyPath":"/az/mexfilik-siyaseti"},"de":{"nav":["Startseite","Projekte","Ökosystem","Team","Vision","Partner","Nachrichten","Über uns"],"footer":["Deshalb haben wir den Namen Vertex gewählt, der all diese Bedeutungen und mehr vereint. Wir wurden 2023 in Istanbul gegründet und nahmen unsere Tätigkeit in über 190 Ländern auf. Im Sinne unseres Namens werden wir unser volles Potenzial entfalten und gemeinsam den Gipfel erreichen, zum Wohlstand der Menschheit beitragen und die Technologien von morgen gestalten.","Projekte","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Unternehmen","Über Uns","Team","Vision","Kontakt","E-Mail Senden","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Datenschutz","Nutzungsbedingungen"],"privacyPath":"/de/datenschutzrichtlinie"},"es":{"nav":["Inicio","Proyectos","Ecosistema","Equipo","Visión","Socios","Noticias","Sobre nosotros"],"footer":["Por eso elegimos el nombre Vertex, que reúne todos estos significados y muchos más. Fundada en Estambul en 2023, nuestra organización comenzó a operar en más de 190 países. Fieles al significado de Vertex, desplegaremos todo nuestro potencial y alcanzaremos juntos la cima; contribuiremos al bienestar de la humanidad y daremos forma a las tecnologías del mañana.","Proyectos","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Empresa","Sobre Nosotros","Equipo","Visión","Contacto","Enviar Email","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Política de Privacidad","Términos de Uso"],"privacyPath":"/es/politica-de-privacidad"},"fr":{"nav":["Accueil","Projets","Écosystème","Équipe","Vision","Partenaires","Actualités","À propos"],"footer":["C'est pourquoi nous avons choisi le nom Vertex, qui réunit toutes ces significations et bien d'autres. Fondés à Istanbul en 2023, nous avons commencé à exercer nos activités dans plus de 190 pays. Fidèles au sens de notre nom, nous révélerons tout notre potentiel et atteindrons ensemble les sommets ; nous contribuerons à la prospérité de l'humanité et façonnerons les technologies de demain.","Projets","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Entreprise","À Propos","Équipe","Vision","Contact","Envoyer un E-mail","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Politique de Confidentialité","Conditions d'Utilisation"],"privacyPath":"/fr/politique-de-confidentialite"},"hi":{"nav":["होम","परियोजनाएं","पारिस्थितिकी तंत्र","टीम","दृष्टि","साझेदार","समाचार","हमारे बारे में"],"footer":["इसीलिए हमने Vertex नाम चुना, जिसमें ये सभी अर्थ और बहुत कुछ समाहित है। 2023 में इस्तांबुल में स्थापित होने के बाद हमने 190 से अधिक देशों में कार्य करना शुरू किया। Vertex नाम की भावना के अनुरूप हम अपनी पूरी क्षमता को सामने लाकर साथ मिलकर शिखर तक पहुँचेंगे, मानवता की समृद्धि में योगदान देंगे और कल की तकनीकों को आकार देंगे।","कंपनी","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","कंपनी","हमारे बारे में","टीम","दृष्टि","संपर्क","ईमेल भेजें","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","गोपनीयता नीति","उपयोग की शर्तें"],"privacyPath":"/hi/gopaniyata-niti"},"id":{"nav":["Beranda","Proyek","Ekosistem","Tim","Visi","Mitra","Berita","Tentang Kami"],"footer":["Itulah alasan kami memilih nama Vertex, yang mencakup semua makna tersebut dan lebih banyak lagi. Didirikan di Istanbul pada 2023, kami mulai beroperasi di lebih dari 190 negara. Sesuai makna Vertex, kami akan mengembangkan seluruh potensi kami dan bersama-sama mencapai puncak, meningkatkan kesejahteraan umat manusia, serta membentuk teknologi masa depan.","Proyek","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Perusahaan","Tentang Kami","Tim","Visi","Kontak","Kirim Email","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Kebijakan Privasi","Syarat Penggunaan"],"privacyPath":"/id/kebijakan-privasi"},"it":{"nav":["Home","Progetti","Ecosistema","Team","Visione","Partner","Notizie","Chi siamo"],"footer":["Ecco perché abbiamo scelto il nome Vertex, che racchiude tutti questi significati e molti altri. Fondata a Istanbul nel 2023, la nostra organizzazione ha iniziato a operare in oltre 190 Paesi. Fedeli al significato di Vertex, esprimeremo tutto il nostro potenziale e raggiungeremo insieme la vetta, contribuendo al benessere dell'umanità e plasmando le tecnologie di domani.","Progetti","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Azienda","Chi Siamo","Team","Visione","Contatti","Invia Email","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Privacy Policy","Termini d'Uso"],"privacyPath":"/it/informativa-sulla-privacy"},"ja":{"nav":["ホーム","プロジェクト","エコシステム","チーム","ビジョン","パートナー","ニュース","私たちについて"],"footer":["私たちがVertexという名前を選んだのは、こうした意味のすべて、そしてそれ以上の可能性を込めたかったからです。2023年にイスタンブールで設立され、190を超える国々で活動を開始しました。Vertexの名にふさわしく、私たちは可能性を最大限に引き出し、共に頂点を目指し、人類の繁栄に貢献しながら未来のテクノロジーを形づくります。","プロジェクト","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","企業","私たちについて","チーム","ビジョン","お問い合わせ","メールを送る","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","プライバシーポリシー","利用規約"],"privacyPath":"/ja/puraibashi-porishi"},"ko":{"nav":["홈","프로젝트","생태계","팀","비전","파트너","뉴스","회사 소개"],"footer":["우리가 Vertex라는 이름을 선택한 이유는 이 모든 의미와 그 이상의 가능성을 담고 있기 때문입니다. 2023년 이스탄불에서 설립된 우리는 190개 이상의 국가에서 활동을 시작했습니다. Vertex라는 이름에 걸맞게 잠재력을 온전히 발휘하고 함께 정상에 오르며, 인류의 번영에 기여하고 미래의 기술을 만들어 나가겠습니다.","프로젝트","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","회사","회사 소개","팀","비전","연락","이메일 보내기","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","개인 정보 보호 정책","이용 약관"],"privacyPath":"/ko/gaein-jeongbo-cheori-bangchim"},"nl":{"nav":["Home","Projecten","Ecosysteem","Team","Visie","Partners","Nieuws","Over ons"],"footer":["Daarom kozen we de naam Vertex, die al deze betekenissen en meer omvat. We zijn in 2023 opgericht in Istanbul en begonnen actief te worden in meer dan 190 landen. In lijn met de betekenis van Vertex willen we ons volledige potentieel benutten en samen de top bereiken, bijdragen aan de welvaart van de mensheid en de technologieën van morgen vormgeven.","Projecten","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Bedrijf","Over Ons","Team","Visie","Contact","Stuur E-mail","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Privacybeleid","Gebruiksvoorwaarden"],"privacyPath":"/nl/privacybeleid"},"pt":{"nav":["Início","Projetos","Ecossistema","Equipe","Visão","Parceiros","Notícias","Sobre nós"],"footer":["Foi por isso que escolhemos o nome Vertex, que reúne todos estes significados e muitos outros. Fundada em Istambul em 2023, a nossa organização começou a atuar em mais de 190 países. Fiéis ao significado de Vertex, vamos alcançar todo o nosso potencial e chegar juntos ao topo, contribuindo para a prosperidade da humanidade e moldando as tecnologias de amanhã.","Projetos","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Empresa","Sobre Nós","Equipe","Visão","Contato","Enviar E-mail","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Política de Privacidade","Termos de Uso"],"privacyPath":"/pt/politica-de-privacidade"},"ru":{"nav":["Главная","Проекты","Экосистема","Команда","Видение","Партнеры","Новости","О нас"],"footer":["Именно поэтому мы выбрали название Vertex, объединяющее все эти значения и многое другое. Основанная в Стамбуле в 2023 году, наша компания начала работать более чем в 190 странах. Следуя смыслу названия Vertex, мы раскроем весь свой потенциал и вместе достигнем вершины, будем способствовать процветанию человечества и создавать технологии будущего.","Проекты","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","Компания","О Нас","Команда","Видение","Контакт","Отправить Email","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","Политика Конфиденциальности","Условия Использования"],"privacyPath":"/ru/politika-konfidencialnosti"},"zh":{"nav":["首页","项目","生态系统","团队","愿景","合作伙伴","新闻","关于我们"],"footer":["这正是我们选择 Vertex 这个名字的原因：它涵盖了所有这些含义，甚至更多。我们于 2023 年在伊斯坦布尔创立，并开始在 190 多个国家开展业务。秉承 Vertex 之名的寓意，我们将充分释放潜能，携手登上高峰，为人类创造繁荣，并塑造未来的科技。","项目","Cortex","Mergen","Ally","公司","关于我们","团队","愿景","联系我们","发送电子邮件","LinkedIn","Instagram","X","隐私政策","使用条款"],"privacyPath":"/zh/yinsi-zhengce"}};
